{"version":1,"content":"<p>【對賭 ... 😂】網絡設備巨頭 Cisco 總裁兼產品長 Jeetu Patel 公開表示，公司決定豪賭「生成式 AI」，欽點年僅 27 歲的工程師 Padmanabhan Krishnamurthy 領軍，在 24 個月內，利用 AI 重構並重寫公司高達 98% 的舊有程式碼（Legacy Code）。</p><p>為確保工程不受運算資源限制，Patel 不僅向他提供無上限的「Token」預算，更鼓勵他「放手去瘋狂嘗試」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.979864+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:36:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.065537+00:00","content_hash":"0298634e48a26d742066e7eab529c4cc07dfde2cb236b488931cb435efbd54d4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}